 ],
 "notes": "Policy text references the topic ARN so it is unknown at plan time; declared-block alternatives cover it. The topic's KMS key must be a key or alias the template creates (an AWS-managed alias/aws/sns does not count as a dedicated customer-managed key). The integration->topic link accepts a reference, the literal topic name, or a request template held in a local whose name mentions sns/topic (locals are invisible). The publish grant is not bound to the integration's role (the policy text sits in a separate policy document), so role_publish and role_policy_attached are checked separately."
}